  "body": "## Summary\n\nAdd the #5861 decision record for board-scoped roles/actions, signed moderation hooks, separate private reports and public append-only audit, and appeals. It explicitly corrects #5680's #835 cross-reference: #835 covers world-session capabilities; public-board authority comes from signed board roles.\n\nCloses #5861 on merge; the issue remains open until this document lands.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** #5861 had no decision record on the base branch.\n- **After:** `doc/2026-11-08_design_id5861.md` cites the board design, #835 design, and current board implementation; all local links resolve. `git diff --check` passes.\n- **Checks:** design-doc-only change. CI policy classifies prose as tier 0 (no check or markdown lint only); no local markdownlint/link-check executable is installed.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way — the decision record can be amended before implementation.\n\n**Blast Radius:** documentation only.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796773082&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7857&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7857&signature=313b66c982669b9e83f301704aad74efd6144cbbad047c4655eda75a7c6763a7\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7857?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
